ABOUT THE ROLE

As a Cloud Data Engineer (Kubernetes/Trino), youll play a key role in building a scalable, secure Trino platform that enables efficient access to Azure Data Lake across multiple teams. Youll design and deploy high-availability AKS clusters, automate infrastructure with Terraform, and integrate modern authentication and observability tools. This role offers the opportunity to shape a production-grade, multi-tenant data service in a forward-thinking, cloud-first engineering environment.

WHAT YOU WILL DO
Deploy and scale Trino clusters on Azure AKS with HA setup;
Configure secure access to Azure Data Lake via SQL endpoint;
Implement multi-tenancy and workload isolation for multiple team use;
Integrate Azure AD / modern auth for user and service identity management;
Collaborate on observability: metrics, logs, distributed tracing;
Troubleshoot and resolve production issues across networking, authentication, and workloads;
Manage infrastructure automation using Azure DevOps pipelines;
Contribute to internal governance, security review, and cost approval processes.
MUST HAVES
8+ years of experience in Cloud Infrastructure / DevOps Engineering;
5+ years of Kubernetes experience (AKS preferred) covering deployment, scaling, security, RBAC, and HA workloads;
Strong knowledge of Azure services: AKS, Azure AD, Networking (VNet, NSG, Subnets), Storage, Key Vault, Monitoring, and Cost Management;
Experience with SQL engines, preferably Trino, Presto, or similar distributed query engines;
Hands-on experience with infrastructure as code (Terraform);
Experience integrating with observability platforms (Prometheus, Grafana, Azure Monitor, or similar);
Strong troubleshooting experience in production distributed systems;
Experience in CI/CD pipelines with Azure DevOps;
Upper-intermediate English level.
NICE TO HAVES
Experience with multi-tenant service design;
Observability / telemetry tooling expertise;
Knowledge of data engineering / lakehouse patterns.
PERKS AND BENEFITS
Remote work & Local connection: Work where you feel most productive and connect with your team in periodic meet-ups to strengthen your network and connect with other top experts.
Legal presence in India: We ensure full local compliance with a structured, secure work environment tailored to Indian regulations.
Competitive Compensation in INR: Fair compensation in INR with dedicated budgets for your personal growth, education, and wellness.
Innovative Projects: Leverage the latest tech and create cutting-edge solutions for world-recognized clients and the hottest startups.

